ai clerk (notes only)

constitution (split from this file):
  src/lib.rs          stance
  src/ids.rs          linkable identifiers
  src/links.rs        stable paths for every entity
  src/types.rs        seats, hearing, phases, kinds, rules
  src/events.rs       the only way anything happens
  src/state.rs        principals, cases, policies, attempt journal
  src/scoring.rs      weighted plurality (no pairwise)
  src/config.rs       discord role id → seat + weight
  src/reducer.rs      the constitution

franchise is a standing bench from discord roles, snapshotted
when deliberation opens. hearing is opt-in. a cheat case is a
record, not a trial. verdicts are frozen snapshots.
